{"id":1428,"title":"斐波那契数列","summary":"Example: Fibonacci Series","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"48f08437-7800-36af-9f69-5d6e7bc053c7","knowledge_id":51,"title":"示例：递归斐波那契数列","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":51,"title":"示例：递归斐波那契数列","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"641fc56e-ddee-3346-ad76-ccec9bb8d84d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"斐波那契数列是一个下一项为前两项之和的数列。数列的前两项是**0**和**1**，比如前7个数字为:\n\n```text\n0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8\n```\n\n假设第`n`个斐波那契数为`fib(n)`，则前`n`个数为:\n\n```text\n0, 1, 1, … fib(n - 2),  fib(n - 1), fib(n)\n```\n\n其中:\n- `fib(n) = fib(n-1) + fib(n-2)`\n- `fib(0)=0` 且 `fib(1)=1`\n\n\n现在，让我们试着用递归思想来编写斐波那契数列问题。","text_html":"<p>斐波那契数列是一个下一项为前两项之和的数列。数列的前两项是<strong>0</strong>和<strong>1</strong>，比如前7个数字为:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8\n</code></pre>\n<p>假设第<code>n</code>个斐波那契数为<code>fib(n)</code>，则前<code>n</code>个数为:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">0, 1, 1, … fib(n - 2),  fib(n - 1), fib(n)\n</code></pre>\n<p>其中:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>fib(n) = fib(n-1) + fib(n-2)</code></li>\n<li><code>fib(0)=0</code> 且 <code>fib(1)=1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>现在，让我们试着用递归思想来编写斐波那契数列问题。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c9816afa-462f-38b4-9c9d-a9abe352ddb2","knowledge_id":52,"title":"递归思考过程","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":52,"title":"递归思考过程","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4f33b0b9-6b8f-37a8-9ba9-2d5f8507a41f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**1. 在每次递归调用中，我们能做的最少的工作？**\n\n在每次递归调用中，能做的最少的工作是将`fib(n - 1)`的值与 `fib(n - 2)`的值相加，得到`fib(n)`.\n\n**2. 递归函数何时停止？(终止条件）**\n\n当`n`为**0**或**1**时，直接返回为**0**和**1**。因为`fib(0)=0` 、`fib(1)=1`。\n\n用代码描述即如下:","text_html":"<p><strong>1. 在每次递归调用中，我们能做的最少的工作？</strong></p>\n<p>在每次递归调用中，能做的最少的工作是将<code>fib(n - 1)</code>的值与 <code>fib(n - 2)</code>的值相加，得到<code>fib(n)</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>2. 递归函数何时停止？(终止条件）</strong></p>\n<p>当<code>n</code>为<strong>0</strong>或<strong>1</strong>时，直接返回为<strong>0</strong>和<strong>1</strong>。因为<code>fib(0)=0</code> 、<code>fib(1)=1</code>。</p>\n<p>用代码描述即如下:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"10d93809-71b1-3e8a-b076-c9cda6f1e4a7","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"if n == 0 or n == 1:\n    return n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d4fefbfb-d3b2-3ae9-a9bc-a99740994437","knowledge_id":53,"title":"示例代码","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":53,"title":"示例代码","knowledges":[{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6efd568f-83a6-38bc-a489-e02c3c060d67","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def fib(num):\n\n    # 终止条件\n    # 如果数字是1或0，则返回1和0。\n    if num == 1 or num == 0:\n        return num\n\n    # 在每次递归调用中要执行的最少工作量\n    return fib(num-1) + fib(num-2)\n\nresult = fib(4)\nprint(result)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"09a262f3-a21e-3e92-a2f9-8b1ad05369d8","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**输出**\n\n```text\n3\n```\n\n这里只打印第5个斐波那契数(从0开始计数)，即`3`。","text_html":"<p><strong>输出</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">3\n</code></pre>\n<p>这里只打印第5个斐波那契数(从0开始计数)，即<code>3</code>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"52f3cf8e-edb7-3f70-a9c5-1f84cade2c40","knowledge_id":54,"title":"递归实现原理","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":54,"title":"递归实现原理","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"40585437-99ab-3c79-91fc-54b09f38b1aa","title":"","title_html":"","text":"斐波那契数列的代码很容易编写。然而，它的实现原理却很复杂。","text_html":"<p>斐波那契数列的代码很容易编写。然而，它的实现原理却很复杂。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1ac442e8-1044-3378-960c-4f73f36cc7ac","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/67e48da8e9c75ed5397f.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":260,"size_in_bytes":15050,"name":"recursion-4.1.5.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3eca246e-85d7-32ea-a2c7-c7ec05d888d3","title":"","title_html":"","text":"现在，让我们来看看代码的实现原理。","text_html":"<p>现在，让我们来看看代码的实现原理。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"31769f67-819f-38ff-81fb-e314e31ecc15","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/19f9d0a54f57f3d16946.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":288,"size_in_bytes":14231,"name":"recursion-4.1.6.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"23f4ac6a-70e4-3286-a95c-3dc56c173303","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在第二次调用中，应该是 `fib(3) + fib(2)`。但是，只有在 `fib(3)` 返回值后，`fib(2)` 才会被求值。","text_html":"<p>在第二次调用中，应该是 <code>fib(3) + fib(2)</code>。但是，只有在 <code>fib(3)</code> 返回值后，<code>fib(2)</code> 才会被求值。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2c2fb7ba-c52f-3cd8-ae39-12794f9f35b8","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/f274237940795c820045.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":504,"size_in_bytes":36299,"name":"recursion-4.1.7.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f5acaf3c-b1db-3ea5-b87c-234436fe159e","title":"","title_html":"","text":"由于 `fib(1)` 返回 **1** 到 `fib(2)`，因此 `fib(2)` 会进行另一次递归调用，即 `fib(2-2)`。\n\n然后，`fib(0)` 返回 **0** 到 `fib(2)`。现在，`fib(2)` 可以最终执行 `fib(2-1) + fib(2-2)`，并将值 **1** + **0** 返回给 `fib(3)`。","text_html":"<p>由于 <code>fib(1)</code> 返回 <strong>1</strong> 到 <code>fib(2)</code>，因此 <code>fib(2)</code> 会进行另一次递归调用，即 <code>fib(2-2)</code>。</p>\n<p>然后，<code>fib(0)</code> 返回 <strong>0</strong> 到 <code>fib(2)</code>。现在，<code>fib(2)</code> 可以最终执行 <code>fib(2-1) + fib(2-2)</code>，并将值 <strong>1</strong> + <strong>0</strong> 返回给 <code>fib(3)</code>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6c316231-0098-33a5-80fb-bfad47116245","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/9bd3b7e9301eb93d3b5d.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":504,"size_in_bytes":50527,"name":"recursion-4.1.8.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"03c9e0e0-1f34-3c2d-8320-d5174080c4c2","title":"","title_html":"","text":"由于 `fib(3-1)` 已返回值，现在可以调用 `fib(3-2)`。函数 `fib(1)` 向 `fib(3)` 返回**1**。","text_html":"<p>由于 <code>fib(3-1)</code> 已返回值，现在可以调用 <code>fib(3-2)</code>。函数 <code>fib(1)</code> 向 <code>fib(3)</code> 返回<strong>1</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":8},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"39bf5b60-98ee-3def-8429-1d48682bb118","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/5bece27cb45aa42dc8e8.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":336,"size_in_bytes":23262,"name":"recursion-4.1.9.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":9},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"adbaf618-83bb-38ec-a2ac-d0b7c6705678","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里，`fib(3)` 向 `fib(4)` 返回 **2** 。由于 `fib(4)` 的值为 `fib(4 - 1)`，因此它调用 `fib(4 - 2)`。","text_html":"<p>在这里，<code>fib(3)</code> 向 <code>fib(4)</code> 返回 <strong>2</strong> 。由于 <code>fib(4)</code> 的值为 <code>fib(4 - 1)</code>，因此它调用 <code>fib(4 - 2)</code>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":10},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"de30b69a-2391-37de-ac93-fb52606138f6","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/84b2fe7e38646cec19e9.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":336,"size_in_bytes":25374,"name":"recursion-4.1.10.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":11},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"caccffbe-93b3-33f5-9bbe-43463a4ec1d3","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里，`fib(2)`调用 `fib(2-1)`。","text_html":"<p>在这里，<code>fib(2)</code>调用 <code>fib(2-1)</code>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":12},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a9415401-41f3-376d-9f62-83c8c55583b1","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/33a226130eb2e68fcced.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":313,"size_in_bytes":19334,"name":"recursion-4.1.11.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":13},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6ae9a0ac-8c0a-3d67-8a4e-7d79b5573cff","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里，`fib(1)` 向 `fib(2)` 返回 **1**。然后，`fib(2)`调用`fib(2-2)`，即`fib(0)`。","text_html":"<p>在这里，<code>fib(1)</code> 向 <code>fib(2)</code> 返回 <strong>1</strong>。然后，<code>fib(2)</code>调用<code>fib(2-2)</code>，即<code>fib(0)</code>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":14},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"92c73a3c-fa89-3be2-8577-111b7705b0aa","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/4daaa8a1c166855e7824.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":367,"size_in_bytes":28292,"name":"recursion-4.1.12.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":15},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ed6604f2-67d8-3c34-846d-4868e4d40a57","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在这里，`fib(0)`返回 **0** 到 `fib(2)`。","text_html":"<p>在这里，<code>fib(0)</code>返回 <strong>0</strong> 到 <code>fib(2)</code>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":16},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3aa27d68-70a6-31da-9a31-53b395f8aa17","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/884c505b9ad631fcdfe0.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":313,"size_in_bytes":20577,"name":"recursion-4.1.13.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":17},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8c6a4e44-4b5d-3b9d-ade9-9dfa453cdbda","title":"","title_html":"","text":"由于 `fib(2)` 具有来自 `fib(1)` 和 `fib(0)` 的值，因此 `fib(2)` 返回 **1** + **0** 到 `fib(4)`。","text_html":"<p>由于 <code>fib(2)</code> 具有来自 <code>fib(1)</code> 和 <code>fib(0)</code> 的值，因此 <code>fib(2)</code> 返回 <strong>1</strong> + <strong>0</strong> 到 <code>fib(4)</code>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":18},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d6a49e35-e7c1-3913-9a5f-0cb3fecc2141","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/b6b21abf9f91bfea3f9a.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":312,"size_in_bytes":21772,"name":"recursion-4.1.14.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":19},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"73f05ebf-b4a5-32b7-81e6-ca25383cd678","title":"","title_html":"","text":"最后，`fib(4)` 返回 **3** 原始函数调用。","text_html":"<p>最后，<code>fib(4)</code> 返回 <strong>3</strong> 原始函数调用。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":20},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f765b24f-6fea-39b5-9ba4-bb6951b159c2","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/d30369885a64d1489a45.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":313,"size_in_bytes":22012,"name":"recursion-4.1.15.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":21}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4cded728-1174-3194-9cbb-ad011f51f3fb","knowledge_id":55,"title":"打印完整斐波那契数","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":55,"title":"打印完整斐波那契数","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"58c51f16-f958-3f65-8569-400447ca83cf","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在之前的斐波那契数列的程序中，只打印了第**n**个数字。下面是打印完整斐波那契数列的方法，比如打印前5个数:","text_html":"<p>在之前的斐波那契数列的程序中，只打印了第<strong>n</strong>个数字。下面是打印完整斐波那契数列的方法，比如打印前5个数:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d976e7b8-470b-3909-811d-15c570f8361f","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def fib(num):\n\n    if num== 1 or num == 0:\n        return num\n\n    return fib(num-1) + fib(num-2)\n\nfor i in range(5):\n    result = fib(i)\n    print(result)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d544e341-ba59-3f6a-bddf-dee3c4f45ff1","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**输出**\n\n```text\n0\n1\n1\n2\n3\n```","text_html":"<p><strong>输出</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">0\n1\n1\n2\n3\n</code></pre>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"026","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/026/page/1428"}
